sequenceDiagram
    participant Src as Skill/Effect
    participant SB as SkillBuff
    participant BH as BuffStageHandle
    participant BI as BuffInfo
    Src->>SB: AddBuff(buffId,target)
    SB->>BI: Init(buffCfg)
    SB->>BH: EnterStage()
    BH->>SB: 注册 OnBuffTick
    loop 每帧/周期
        SB->>BH: Tick()
        BH->>BI: 应用属性/效果
    end
    SB->>SB: RemoveBuff()
    SB->>BH: ExitStage()
